{"The traceID field was removed from the 'Plugin Request Completed' log line. The old logRequest explicitly extracted the trace ID via tracing.TraceIDFromContext and appended it to logParams, but this was removed in the refactor and the new ContextualLoggerMiddleware.instrumentContext does not add it either, breaking trace-to-log correlation": 0.8165897130966187, "TestLogger.FromContext returns a brand-new TestLogger instance (NewTestLogger()), discarding all accumulated state. Since LoggerMiddleware.logRequest now calls m.logger.FromContext(ctx).Info(...), the log entry goes to this throwaway instance rather than the original TestLogger that tests hold a reference to, making it impossible to assert on InfoLogs.Calls, InfoLogs.Message, or InfoLogs.Ctx": 0.9513569474220276}